Package: dsNoLimits
Title: 'DataSHIELD' Server-Side Nonlinear Mixed-Effects Analysis
Version: 0.0.5.9000
Date: 2026-08-25
Authors@R:
    person("Manuel", "Huth", , "manuel.huth@uni-bonn.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 'DataSHIELD' 'server-side' functions that evaluate the marginal
    log-likelihood and its gradient for nonlinear mixed-effects models of
    longitudinal data, so that a 'client-side' package can drive a federated
    optimisation across several servers and obtain estimates identical to a
    pooled analysis without any individual-level data leaving the server.
